// Reactive stores for collaborative state management.

/**
 * Identity selector that returns the value unchanged.
 * [👤compose📚js🗃️sketchpad💻sketchpad🔖utilities🔖store🛠️identityselector](composerepo://p/u/compose/b/l/js/fd/org/sketchpad/f/Sketchpad.tsx/s/Utilities/s/Store/d/i/identitySelector)
 **/
